1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,695
What if discovering art felt less like scrolling, and more like stepping into

2
00:00:04,695 --> 00:00:05,363
another world?

3
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:08,385
Meet Atelier Atlas.

4
00:00:08,385 --> 00:00:12,873
A world of independent art, where every golden pin is an invitation to

5
00:00:12,873 --> 00:00:14,253
discover a different perspective.

6
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:19,051
Choose a place on the globe.

7
00:00:19,051 --> 00:00:22,736
Even artists who share a city have their own space to tell their

8
00:00:22,736 --> 00:00:23,020
story.

9
00:00:24,350 --> 00:00:26,626
Enter an artist's three dimensional gallery.

10
00:00:26,626 --> 00:00:31,558
Follow a guided view, move between artworks, and open a painting to discover

11
00:00:31,558 --> 00:00:33,454
its title, materials, and meaning.

12
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:38,157
Or take your own path.

13
00:00:38,157 --> 00:00:42,495
Walk through the room, drag to look around, and expand the exhibition.

14
00:00:42,495 --> 00:00:46,110
Gallery layouts adapt to the collection and each painting's proportions.

15
00:00:48,350 --> 00:00:53,390
Artists can connect a Spotify playlist, adding another layer to their exhibition.

16
00:00:53,390 --> 00:00:55,910
Playback stays in Spotify's own controls.

17
00:00:56,910 --> 00:01:02,763
A complete two dimensional collection offers another way to explore, alongside keyboard access,

18
00:01:02,763 --> 00:01:05,465
mobile controls, and reduced motion support.

19
00:01:06,465 --> 00:01:09,171
And you can become part of the atlas.

20
00:01:09,171 --> 00:01:13,569
Create a profile, place your pin, upload your own artwork, and give it

21
00:01:13,569 --> 00:01:14,922
a title and description.

22
00:01:14,922 --> 00:01:17,290
Connect a playlist, then save your gallery.

23
00:01:17,290 --> 00:01:19,996
In this prototype, contributions stay in your browser.

24
00:01:29,465 --> 00:01:33,119
Your new pin opens a gallery built around your work.

25
00:01:33,119 --> 00:01:36,773
Next, we want to make these exhibitions persistent and shared.

26
00:01:37,773 --> 00:01:38,489
Atelier Atlas.

27
00:01:38,489 --> 00:01:41,714
A world of art, a space of your own.

28
00:01:41,714 --> 00:01:44,938
Discover it at atelier atlas dot vercel dot app.
